x86_64-linux  DW.ref.__gxx_personality_v0, on clang's side only: S::~S calls printf, which may throw, and a destructor is noexcept in C++11, so clang wraps the call in the terminate guard - __clang_call_terminate, which tools/mangled-names already excludes as a recorded gap - and the guard is what names the personality routine. cxx1 emits no such guard; the same difference under a data label rather than a call
